 using Khan  Academy and other educational tools the  course concludes with the next steps  section that explores the different  opportunities for further education so  you can continue to learn and innovate  in your classes confer educators was  designed so teachers coaches  administrators could experience Khan  Academy as students so in order to  complete the course you'll need to  engage with exercises master skills and  perform well on the final assessment but  don't worry there's a reward for those  who complete this journey your  professional learning is in your hands  start confers initial course right now  and find out how Khan Academy can expand  the possibilities in your classroom do  you have any questions about the course  access the Help Center for additional  support see you soon
 

